.TH batten-task-unregister 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-task\-unregister \- Drop a task\*(Aqs record, which its exit path does and a kill cannot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten task unregister\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIpid\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Drop a task\*(Aqs record, which its exit path does and a kill cannot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIpid\fR>
The process the record is keyed by
